+- W2-SKILLS save migration (2026-10-21, finish-run review r2; owner_gate of the package): a rev-1 save keeps every learned
+  node but not its unspent SP. Spec 03:14 "cannot afford all nodes simultaneously" and PRD 7.3 back it; the brief said "keep
+  it unless spec 03 says otherwise". Kept nodes that cost more than the character level paid are owed, and new levels pay
